      "decay_ic_3d": 0.038377,
      "decay_ic_5d": 0.022884,
      "decay_ic_10d": -0.003988
    },
    "regime_notes": "Positive IC in all tested regimes; IC and ICIR weakened during 2030-2032 (0.013005 and 0.035657), so use conservatively and monitor drift. Predictive strength is primarily one to three days and reverses by ten days.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_2_20320610_moderate_stress_reversal_signal.csv"
